{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The check for a luncheon of 3 sandwiches, 7 cups of coffee and one piece of pie came to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/534aae88d4677e19dbf63c1654c665a465d70cfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3.15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />. The check for a luncheon consisting of 4 sandwiches, 10 cups of coffee and one piece of pie came to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e6a5f61fb7ae18a457b12b2b342fbcbb1392669.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> at the same place. The cost of a luncheon consisting of one sandwich, one cup of coffee, and one piece of pie at the same place will come to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc6baa67097ed48039c625c7900e72d0c7824270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$1.70 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$1.65 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$1.20 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$1.05 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$0.95$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"510\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the cost of one sandwich, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the cost of one cup of coffee, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the price of one piece of pie.  With the information,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/1/c61a84497e3502a890592987dc0b51407fe10196.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3s+7c+p=3.15\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/7463636d5cd265b49eff34210864f5f6a81f7a82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4s+10c+p=4.20\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtract the first equation from the second to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed25e2d4b508a2f7c1078a0d81ad030153efe191.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[s+3c=1.05\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/47672d4fb741d511651fdc492141c82755582f67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=1.05-3c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />.  Substituting it back in the second equation results in.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/4/31469830ac8ca8d4b798d164b5117d5ef6cd6537.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4.20-12c+10c+p=4.20\\]\" width=\"215\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1afe204e90f6cb5a34d8e8f76477bae7bf8dc02b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=2c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />.  With the substitutions, the cost of one sandwich, one cup of coffee, and one slice of pie is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/2/7425c52207175eff7714772535279183463d69b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1.05-3c)+c+(2c) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$1.05}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"281\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Probl